# Task: Ontology - MCP Server

Set up the Terraform and user-data script for an MCP server.

## Additional Context

This is the pyproject.toml for the project that will be exposing an MCP interface,

```toml
[project]
name = "ontology"
version = "0.0.0"
requires-python = ">=3.14"
dependencies = [
    "Cython==3.2.8",
    "pydantic==2.13.4",
    "pydantic-settings[yaml]==2.14.2",
    "PyYAML==6.0.3",
    "Jinja2==3.1.6",
]

[dependency-groups]
build = [
    "setuptools==83.0.0",
]
test = [
    "pytest==9.1.1",
    "pytest-cov==7.1.0",
    "pytest-xdist==3.8.0"
]
scripts = [
    "pillow==12.3.0",
    "music21==10.5.0",
    "numpy==2.5.4",
    "matplotlib==3.11.2"
]
docs = [
    "mkdocs",
    "mkdocs-material",
    "mkdocstrings[python]",
]
analysis = [
    "gprof2dot",
    "pydeps",
    "vulture"
]
prompts = [
    "panflute"
]

[tool.uv]
package = false
```

This is the Dockerfile for running unit tests and other continuous integration workflows,

```dockerfile
FROM ubuntu:24.04

ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive
ENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
ENV PATH="/root/.local/bin:$PATH"

# Install system build dependencies, SDL2 headers, graphviz, and git
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
    curl \
    ca-certificates \
    git \
    gcc \
    build-essential \
    libsdl2-dev \
    libsdl2-image-dev \
    libsdl2-ttf-dev \
    libsdl2-mixer-dev \
    graphviz \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

# Install uv package manager
RUN curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh

# Pre-install Python 3.14
RUN uv python install 3.14

COPY src /workspace

WORKDIR /workspace
```